    "spec": "The request may carry an 'Idempotency-Key' header. When a create repeats with a key already seen, return the originally created owner with 200 instead of creating a duplicate.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nThe request may carry an 'Idempotency-Key' header. When a create repeats with a key already seen, return the originally created owner with 200 instead of creating a duplicate.\n"
  },
